<title>USA: Procter &amp; Gamble raises qtly div to $0.505.</title>
<headline>Procter &amp; Gamble raises qtly div to $0.505.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.505		     $0.45</p>
<p> Pay		   Aug 15</p>
<p> Record		July 18</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Procter &amp; Gamble Co.</p>
<p>Following a two-for-one stock split, declared July 8, the annual dividend on the company's common stock will be $1.01.</p>
